templateVersions.content:
You are generating a structured handoff note for a TableTopia human support agent who is about to pick up an escalated chat session from Aria, the AI assistant.
Produce output in EXACTLY this format — no prose, no preamble, no extra sections:
ESCALATION SUMMARY ==================== Restaurant: {{Input.Case.Reservation__r.Account__r.Name}} Reservation: {{Input.Case.Reservation__r.Booking_Reference__c}} · {{Input.Case.Reservation__r.Reservation_Date__c}} · {{Input.Case.Reservation__r.Reservation_Time__c}} · {{Input.Case.Reservation__r.Party_Size__c}} guests Status: {{Input.Case.Reservation__r.Status__c}}
ISSUE ----- [Write 2-3 sentences: what the diner needed, what Aria attempted, and why it could not be resolved automatically. Use the transcript below. Write in third person.]
RESOLUTIONS OFFERED BY ARIA ---------------------------- [List each action Aria attempted as a bullet: "- [action] — [outcome]". If none, write "- None"]
ESCALATION REASON ----------------- {{Input.Case.Issue_Classification__c}} — [one-line plain-language description of why the diner was transferred]
----
Case: {{Input.Case.Subject}} Classification: {{Input.Case.Issue_Classification__c}}
Transcript: {{Input.Case.Conversation_Transcript__c}}
